p(67,'Recovering characteristic-two connection data',[258],'The scan90 margin asks about the general case and characteristic2.','Retain the quotient connection or enough projective-group data; the restriction C_Omega alone loses the normal coefficient at2.','C-SA04-250/251; the exact matrix shows what vanishes. Stacks10.133.6 gives the first-order universal property, without restoring lost factor2 information.',['BStacks09CN'],'Worth a short reconstruction task to formulate the correct marked-group version in characteristic2.')
p(68,'Identity and zero-index arrows on scan82',[224,225,227],'Several vertical arrows are queried, including an id label and the n=0/nonzero condition.','For nonzero n the frame power map and -1/n dlog are valid locally; dlog exp=id explains one arrow.','C-SA04-224/226 and the explicit local computations settle the plausible analytic arrows. The Codex n≠0 reading weakens the earlier note’s explicitly conditional group-level zero-index interpretation.',['BDumas2009'],'Primarily a scan-reading task; keep the correct elementary mu_0 kernel identity separate from identifying the intended arrow.')
